OL,3,GNEWSADoctors begin fresh strike over
OL,4,Apay dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FConsultants and specialist doctors have
OL,7,Fbegun a 24-hour strike as part of an
OL,8,Fongoing dispute over pay.
OL,10,FIt follows a separate 24-hour strike on
OL,11,FFriday in which resident doctors took
OL,12,Findustrial action as part of the same
OL,13,Fdispute.
OL,15,FThe British Medical Association (BMA)
OL,16,Frejected a recommended 3.5% pay rise
OL,17,Fand wants to restore the value of
OL,18,Fdoctors' pay to 2008 levels.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
